{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":20,"ref":"2-chronicles 20:20","book":"2-chronicles","lang":"id","chapter":20,"translation":"Lalu mereka bersiap pagi-pagi dan keluar ke padang gurun Tekoa, dan ketika mereka keluar, berdirilah Yehoshafat dan berkata: “Dengarkanlah aku, hai Yehudah dan penduduk Yerushalayim! Percayalah kepada Yahweh, Elohim kalian, maka kalian akan ditegakkan; percayalah kepada nabi-nabi-Nya, maka kalian akan berhasil.”","tokens":[{"surface":"וישכימו","gloss":"dan mereka bersiap pagi-pagi"},{"surface":"בבקר","gloss":"di pagi hari"},{"surface":"ויצאו","gloss":"dan keluarlah"},{"surface":"למדבר","gloss":"ke padang gurun"},{"surface":"תקוע","gloss":"Tekoa"},{"surface":"ובצאתם","gloss":"dan ketika keluarnya mereka"},{"surface":"עמד","gloss":"berdirilah"},{"surface":"יהושפט","gloss":"Yehoshafat"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"dan berkata"},{"surface":"שמעוני","gloss":"dengarkanlah aku"},{"surface":"יהודה","gloss":"Yehudah"},{"surface":"וישבי","gloss":"dan penduduk"},{"surface":"ירושלם","gloss":"Yerushalayim"},{"surface":"האמינו","gloss":"percayalah"},{"surface":"ביהוה","gloss":"kepada Yahweh"},{"surface":"אלהיכם","gloss":"Elohim kalian"},{"surface":"ותאמנו","gloss":"maka kalian akan ditegakkan"},{"surface":"האמינו","gloss":"percayalah"},{"surface":"בנביאיו","gloss":"kepada nabi-nabi-Nya"},{"surface":"והצליחו","gloss":"maka kalian akan berhasil"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T10:15:28.735753417Z","model":"glm-5.2"}